# Real-robot profile skeleton for the console BT.
#
# STATUS: TEMPLATE_ONLY.  Nothing here is a measured real-robot value, and this
# file is not loaded by default (`.yaml.template` is not matched by *.yaml
# tooling).  Copy it to bt_console_real.yaml only after a signed work order.
#
# What is safe to confirm on site: topic names (they are wiring, not physics).
# What is NOT here on purpose: arrival distance, arrival/path timeouts and dwell
# are tree XML ports, and every physical criterion needs a signed work order
# (note/10_真机上机Runbook.md:4, note/11 migration rules).  Do not add numbers.
goal_topic: /v8/bt/goal
